  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wWM3IZQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"3840\" height=\"1219\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>《Reliquified Twilight Forest》是 Relics 与暮色森林之间的兼容插件，为暮色森林维度添加了数个独具特色的主题遗物。目前，该插件新增了 7 种遗物，可通过击败暮色森林中的 Boss 获得。这些遗物将赋予玩家其原持有者拥有的部分能力。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5xsiBjv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"613\" height=\"100\"></p>\n<p>依赖项：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Relics 模组</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">暮色森林 模组</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/l1Kt0vx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"473\" height=\"100\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>1.21.1：</strong> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/reliquified-twilight-forest/files/all?page=1&pageSize=20&version=1.21.1&gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fmbtbFi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"193\" height=\"100\"></p>\n<p><strong>Q：我可以在整合包中使用此模组吗？</strong><br>A：可以，欢迎添加。</p>\n<p><strong>Q：我可以将此模组重新发布到其他资源站吗？</strong><br>A：不可以。</p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/V2jX1pa.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pHren9yxzW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gG6f4t0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Octo-Studios/reliquified-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sK6KJcQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252freliquified-twilight-forest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OYN08d0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253freturn%253dhttps%253a%252f%252flegacy.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f1186617%2526cn%253dAdd%2bspecial%2binstructions%2bto%2bthe%2baddon%2bauthor()%2526business%253dp%2540foxy.cat%2526bn%253dPP-DonationsBF%253abtn_donateCC_LG.gif%253aNonHosted%2526cancel_return%253dhttps%253a%252f%252flegacy.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f1186617%2526lc%253dUS%2526item_name%253dReliquified%2bTwilight%2bForest%2b(from%2bcurseforge.com)%2526cmd%253d_donations%2526rm%253d1%2526no_shipping%253d1%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fPIlVls.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>想体验我们的其他模组吗？访问 <span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><a style=\"color:#b96ad9\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252focto-studios.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OCTO-STUDIOS.COM</a></span> 了解更多详情！</strong></p>\n</div>",
